I suspect that you were already badly damaged in the combat.  I'll only
eat the corpse if I am well over 75% of my max hit points.

Others have mentioned containers and pets so I'll add troll dancing. 
Kill a handful of trolls for the experience and only eat the last one. 
Let the rest resurrect and kill them again for the XP.  There's code
that turns down their chances of death drops after they have resurrected
the first time so it's less efficient for getting objects but that odes
work somewhat.  If you want another level and you are close to the score
needed troll dancing can push you up.  Each XP level takes more than the
previous so combat works less and less as the game progresses.  Troll
dancing can work when it carries some risk.  By the time there's near
zero risk it does not give enough points for the next level.


